title: "Manipulator Kinematics"
abstract: >-
  Forward and inverse kinematics for serial manipulators, with the Jacobian
  conditioning and singularity detection needed to say which solver a given arm
  and target set actually calls for, measured over published parameter sets
  rather than argued from taste.
